=   entry .Error   raised when delimited text cannot be parsed, or a row cannot be decoded
-     detail
+     detail

-         Error `↯/s.83.1`, with a subcode from its `#reason`. A **parse** failure, a quote found after
-         the start of an unquoted cell, reads _could not parse row data at row `row`, column
-         `column` because a quote was found after the start of a cell_, and carries the 1-based
-         row and column and the character offset into the input. A **decode** failure reads
-         _could not decode the cell because the cell was absent_, or _because the value `value`
-         could not be parsed as `expected`_; its position is not in the error itself (`#row` and
-         `#column` are `Prim`, `#offset` is `0`) but in the `CellRef` focus an accruing
-         strategy records with it.
+         Erro `↯/s.83.1`, com um subcódigo vindo de seu `#reason`. Uma falha de **análise**, uma
+         aspa encontrada depois do início de uma célula sem aspas, diz _could not parse row data
+         at row `row`, column `column` because a quote was found after the start of a cell_, e
+         carrega a linha e a coluna, contadas a partir de 1, e o deslocamento em caracteres na
+         entrada. Uma falha de **decodificação** diz _could not decode the cell because the cell
+         was absent_, ou _because the value `value` could not be parsed as `expected`_; sua
+         posição não está no próprio erro (`#row` e `#column` são `Prim`, `#offset` é `0`), mas
+         no foco `CellRef` que uma estratégia acumulativa registra com ele.

